asynchronous messaging service.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:44.070
The subsequent
microservices, which

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:45.720
are also deployed
on the Cloud Run,

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:48.630
can then subscribe to
these Pub/Sub events.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:51.030
These microservices
can then make calls

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:53.050
to the other parts
of the architecture.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:56.080
As you can see in the
examples over here.

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.840
And if we wanted to take a
look at a real life example,

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:00.720
we have Arabesque AI.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:04.350
Arabesque AI provides AI
driven asset management.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.900
And, amongst other
incredible results,

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:10.260
they were able to reduce their
